chmod: cannot access 'rabbitmqadmin': No such file or directory
mv: cannot stat 'rabbitmqadmin': No such file or directory

$ rabbitmqadmin declare queue name=sms durable=true
queue declared

$ rabbitmqadmin declare exchange name=payments type=topic
exchange declared

$ rabbitmqadmin declare binding source=payments destination=sms routing_key=payment.completed
binding declared

$ rabbitmqadmin publish exchange=payments routing_key=payment.completed payload='{"event":"PaymentCompleted","paymentId":"PAY-1001"}'
Message published

$ sudo rabbitmqctl list_queues name messages consumers
Timeout: 60.0 seconds ...
Listing queues for vhost / ...
